id: pm-vcs-release-gate
title: Release readiness behind PM_RELEASE_APPROVED
description: "Prepare daily OIDC publishing behind one repository approval variable. Verify metadata, allowlisted packed files, privacy, regression checks, npm and Bun release gates. The owner performs the first npm publish and trusted-publisher setup; keep approval unset."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T23:24:17.719Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-27T11:06:54.532Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-27T10:57:50.192Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-27T05:22:08.000Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: "Deliver release-ready daily OIDC publishing guarded by explicit repository approval and canonical-repository write conditions, with verified package metadata and packed consumers."
expected_result: "Automated publication requires main, the canonical repository, PM_RELEASE_APPROVED and tokenless OIDC provenance; package metadata and documented local first publication remain correct."
actual_result: "Current-main release-approval and related focused checks pass through pinned pm. Inspected workflow, manifest and README satisfy readiness requirements; the merged PR retains complete final npm/Bun and packed inventory/privacy receipts. Owner publication and trust decisions remain unchanged."
comments[18]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T23:24:26.154Z",codex-agent,"Normalize daily scheduling and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED job gates while preserving release decisions, generated changelogs and release notes. Verify OIDC publishing without a stored npm token, manifest metadata, packed allowlists and private-data scans. No open homepage/author PR was found during orientation. No publishing, trust setup, approval variable changes or merges are authorized."
  "2026-10-25T23:29:54.109Z",codex-agent,"Release simulation inspection found two existing blockers after a calendar version bump: changelog scripts fixed the bootstrap date, and release metadata commits omitted a refreshed self-host archive. Removed the fixed date override while preserving --date-from-version and the existing decide step. The commit step now regenerates and stages selfhost.bundle after staging release metadata. A real temporary Git repository verifies that the committed archive covers the newly staged changelog. Independently restoring either the old workflow step or manifest date makes its regression fail; restored preparation tests pass 2/2."
  "2026-10-26T01:04:02.270Z",codex-agent,"Opening the release-readiness PR after package allowlist/privacy verification and focused regression proofs so complete npm and Bun CI can run in parallel with local full-gate verification. Pending checks are explicitly not treated as passing evidence. No timeout, threshold, dependency pin or test case is being relaxed."
  "2026-10-26T01:37:26.244Z",codex-agent,"Read-only GitHub workflow inspection found release.yml manually disabled. Added a narrowly scoped setup workflow that runs on main when release workflow files change (or on manual main dispatch), verifies the existing approval/provenance/manifest contract, confirms main has not advanced, and only then enables release.yml. It never publishes, configures npm trust or changes a repository variable. This activates the guarded schedule automatically after the owner merges, without enabling the older main workflow now. Missing the setup workflow or removing its main-only guard fails the regression; restored check passes 1/1."
  "2026-10-26T02:25:34.636Z",codex-agent,"Required complete npm run release:check and bun run release:check both PASS in isolated GitHub CI at a894f6c03cef736cc52aeedfa4745fc22bc7e433. Main suite counts: npm 1887/1887, Bun 1887/1887; every required matrix job succeeded. Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/actions/runs/40255206749. The complete gates were verified in isolated CI; they were not duplicated on the already contended local host after that success. Committed-source self-host verification also passed locally. No timeout, case, threshold or dependency pin was changed. Packed artifact allowlist/privacy checks and linked regressions passed. Final tracker evidence is being committed and CI will recheck that final head. Keep the item in progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-26T03:35:43.695Z",codex-agent,"PR 152 follow-up: restrict shipped documentation to README-linked guides and examples, scrub machine-specific paths from repository docs, and add a real tarball privacy gate with negative packed-doc regressions. Branch is current with main; no merge needed."
  "2026-10-26T03:41:45.579Z",codex-agent,"Packaging fix: replace broad docs directory inclusion with eleven explicit consumer guides/examples, reducing the packed inventory from 290 to 286 files. Keep certification, audit, receipt and unlinked semantics records in the repository. Neutralized the certification lock path using a TMPDIR placeholder without altering the recorded claim. New pack:check packs with lifecycle scripts disabled, then scans every actual tar member name and contents, including compiled maps, for private paths, hosted-data names and credential shapes; diagnostics omit matched values. Negative real-pack tests cover 19 contamination variants, excluded internal docs, source maps and archive names. Behavioral revert proof: disabling only the classifier makes the packed-guide regression fail (exit 1, missing absolute-home-path finding); restored scanner passes. Initial targeted tests 10/10; new verifier coverage 100/100/100/100; linked pm commands 4/4; typecheck, lint, duplication, docstrings and the 286-file package scan pass. Final checks and CI will verify the committed result."
  "2026-10-26T03:59:32.974Z",codex-agent,"First CI run 40265487199 found one failure on each Node version: the explicit production-source inventory still expected 80 files after adding the pack verifier. Updated it to 81 and asserted that the new verifier is included. No coverage threshold or case was removed. The initial complete suites each ran 1893 tests with only that inventory assertion failing; measured coverage remained 100/100/100/100. Pack regressions passed. Rechecking the inventory locally before rerunning both complete npm and Bun CI gates."
  "2026-10-26T04:22:56.948Z",codex-agent,"CI progress at 7676e0c029c3dab82757c6fa8365f29c07b3f2a3: Node 26 completed both npm run release:check and bun run release:check successfully, each with 1893/1893 main tests, zero fail/skip/cancel and 100/100/100/100 coverage. Both tarball scans inspected 286 files with zero findings. Additional native Bun tests pass 32/32. Node 22 npm passed and its Bun gate remains in progress. Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/actions/runs/40266784080."
  "2026-10-26T04:32:46.820Z",codex-agent,"Complete CI acceptance PASS at 7676e0c029c3dab82757c6fa8365f29c07b3f2a3: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 1893/1893 main tests on both Node 22 and 26, with zero fail/skip/cancel/todo. Every one of the 81 production TypeScript files meets 100% statements, branches, functions and lines. Additional native Bun tests pass 32/32 per matrix job; both Windows launcher jobs pass. All four full-gate tarball scans inspect 286 files with zero findings. Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/actions/runs/40266784080. Local npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run lint, npm run duplicates, npm run docstring, npm run pack:check, npm run changelog:check and npm run accept:self-host pass. Targeted packed-doc and release contracts pass 10/10; raw inventory tests pass 3/3; pm test pm-vcs-release-gate --run --progress passes all 5 linked commands. Behavioral classifier revert fails its negative packed-doc regression; restored verifier has 100/100/100/100 focused coverage. Documentation allowlist is eleven explicit README-linked guides/examples instead of the whole docs directory (290 to 286 packed files). No dependency pin, test case, timeout or coverage threshold was relaxed. Final receipt commit will rerun CI; leave closure to the orchestrator. No merge or publication performed."
  "2026-10-27T00:19:11.667Z",codex-agent,"Review follow-up: preserve existing release-readiness work and merged main changes. Remove automatic release-workflow enablement; the orchestrator enables disabled schedules after merge. Require the canonical repository at job level for every write-permission or publishing job in the affected workflows, alongside the existing approval and branch conditions. Prove guard, approval, provenance and token regressions independently, then wait for complete npm and Bun CI on the pushed head."
  "2026-10-27T00:21:20.916Z",codex-agent,"Packed-artifact verification: 286 allowlisted files; dry-run and actual archive agree, and every packed member has zero private-data findings. Local project health passes with extensions disabled; globally installed extension version skew is outside this package."
  "2026-10-27T00:21:24.510Z",codex-agent,"Fork-exclusion revert proof: node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/release-approval.test.ts passes 6/6. Independently reverting each job repository guard, reverting all repository guards, allowing an OR bypass, removing approval or provenance, injecting a synthetic npm token environment, adding an unguarded CI write job, inheriting CI write permissions, adding a read-permission CI publisher, and restoring automatic setup all fail (each command exits nonzero; 10 independent mutations rejected). Restoring the workflows passes 6/6. Linked pm tests, test typecheck where present and lint pass. Canonical-repository checks include inherited permissions. Disabled release workflows remain for the orchestrator to enable after merge; no live settings or publishing were changed."
  "2026-10-27T03:18:23.038Z",codex-agent,"Independent re-review found the contract covered only release and CI files, missing CodeQL security-events writes, owner-only Dependabot guards and reusable workflow callers. Extend canonical-repository guards to every effectively write-enabled job in every workflow file. Replace regex workflow parsing with a pinned YAML parser, generic permission inheritance and negative fixtures for this full class. Correct local publishing documentation, preserve earlier readiness work, prove source reverts and wait for npm/Bun CI on every final head."
  "2026-10-27T03:59:03.843Z",codex-agent,"Whole-workflow contract passes 30/30 using the pinned YAML parser. It scans every YAML workflow, resolves aliases/flow maps, applies job permission overrides or workflow inheritance, and recognizes any scope with write plus write-all, including reusable callers. Negative fixtures cover CodeQL, owner-only/wrong-repository Dependabot, inherited writes, reusable calls, write-all, future scopes, missing publication approval/provenance, provenance overrides, token environments, OR/negation bypasses and discovery of a new workflow in a non-Git directory. Behavioural revert proof: all 14 independent mutations fail with assertion failures: each write job loses only its repository guard, owner-only/OR guards return, approval/provenance disappear, a synthetic token environment is added, file discovery is narrowed back to release/CI, permission matching returns to a scope allowlist, or inheritance is removed. Restoring the implementation passes 30/30. Linked pm tests and the repository's defined typecheck, lint and duplication checks pass. Maintainer local publishing is authenticated and checked, with no approval-variable hold; the variable gates automated GitHub releases."
  "2026-10-27T10:56:27.342Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit of current main: Inspected current-main daily release workflow, manifest and maintainer documentation. The YAML contract scans every workflow and enforces the exact canonical repository on write-enabled jobs, main and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED on publishers, OIDC provenance, public npm access and no npm token environments. Negative fixtures cover inherited permissions, reusable callers, future scopes, aliases and wrong-repository/OR bypasses; plain-directory workflow discovery is covered. The merged PR records allowlisted actual/dry-run tarball parity, privacy scans, real npm/Bun packed consumers, behavioral revert proofs and final complete npm/Bun CI. Initial publication, trust setup and approval remain owner operations. Delivered by PR #152, merge commit a31158d867b02922f092b5f7062a1511806c0007, merged_at 2026-10-27T05:22:08Z. Focused verification follows; full npm and Bun release gates are delegated to PR CI for this tracker-only change."
  "2026-10-27T10:57:47.157Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main with `node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/release-approval.test.ts test/release-preparation.test.ts test/verify-pack-privacy.test.ts test/raw-coverage.test.ts` via the pinned pm linked runner: PASS. Observed test counts: tests=41, pass=41, fail=0, cancelled=0, skipped=0, todo=0. Current-main release-approval and related focused checks pass through pinned pm. Inspected workflow, manifest and README satisfy readiness requirements; the merged PR retains complete final npm/Bun and packed inventory/privacy receipts. Owner publication and trust decisions remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-27T11:06:54.531Z",codex-agent,"Closure validation: health retains the same legacy provenance advisory as untouched main a31158d867b02922f092b5f7062a1511806c0007: provenance_value_domain_invalid:claude-code:role:single_digit:50. Existing item pm-vcs-5lre owns this advisory. Strict health is not clean; the original history bytes remain unchanged. Default health additionally reports the existing global extension version skew. No history repair or dependency change is performed."
